/*
LeetCode 242 - Valid Anagram

Difficulty: Easy

Approach:
Use a hash map (or frequency array) to count the frequency of each character
in the first string and decrement the count while traversing the second string.
If all character frequencies become zero, the two strings are anagrams.

Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)   // O(26) for lowercase English letters
*/
class Solution {
public:
    bool isAnagram(string s, string t) {
        sort(s.begin(),s.end());
        sort(t.begin(),t.end());
        return s==t;
        
    }
};